@startuml
title E2 - Napaka pri shranjevanju in ponovni poskus

actor "Uporabnik" as User
boundary "PovratnaInfoMaska" as UI
control "PovratneInfoKontroler" as Controller
entity "PovratneInformacije" as Feedback
entity "Skupine" as Groups

Sistem -> User: prikaže poziv za oddajo

User -> UI: odpre obrazec
activate UI

User -> UI: vnese oceno in komentar
User -> UI: odda obrazec

UI -> Controller: oddajPovratnoInfo(..., ocena, komentar, jwt)
activate Controller

Controller -> Feedback: preveriŽeOddano(...)
activate Feedback
Feedback --> Controller: niOddano = da
deactivate Feedback

Controller -> Feedback: shraniPovratnoInfo(...)
activate Feedback
Feedback --> Controller: napakaPriShranjevanju
deactivate Feedback

Controller --> UI: napaka (shranjevanje ni uspelo)
UI --> User: ponudi ponovni poskus

User -> UI: ponovno odda obrazec

UI -> Controller: oddajPovratnoInfo(..., ocena, komentar, jwt)

Controller -> Feedback: shraniPovratnoInfo(...)
activate Feedback
Feedback --> Controller: shranjeno
deactivate Feedback

Controller -> Groups: posodobiPovprečnoOceno(...)
activate Groups
Groups --> Controller: ocenaPosodobljena
deactivate Groups

Controller --> UI: uspeh
deactivate Controller

UI --> User: potrditev oddaje
deactivate UI
@enduml